title: meetZoe
position: -947,-14
---
<<declare $zoeSpeak = true>>
Zoe: Hi I'm Zoe, who are you? And why are you here?
<<if set_flag("metZoe")>><<endif>>
-> Hi, I'm Kher.
	<<if get_flag("deadDad")>> 
	I'm here about my dad.
	Zoe: Oh, for the little I knew your father I'm very sorry.
	<<elseif true>>.
	Zoe: Are you Joh's kid? Maybe go talk to the nurse. I don't want to deal with you.
	She waves at you like she wants you out of her office.
	<<endif>>
	<<return>>
