//DIALOGUE
title:zoeSDA
---
She rolls her eyes like you just completely ruined her day just by asking that. 
Zoe: Look it is not that complicated.
Zoe: Go to the log and download the report of your arrival.
Zoe: Get your father's medical documentation.
Zoe: Go to wherever your father lived log in his personal KomPat and download his will.
	-> So Log, Documents and Will?
		Zoe: Yes. Exactly.
		Zoe: Are we done here or do you need me to draw you a picture?
		-> Yes, draw me a picture.
			Zoe: ...
		-> ...
	-> Ok thanks.
		Zoe: Now go, I've work that needs to be done.
<<if set_flag("SDA")>><<endif>>
===
title:zoeKeys
---
Zoe: Sure ok. But I don't have time now.
Zoe: Come pick them up tomorrow, for now keep using Sully's.
<<if set_flag("zoeKeys")>><<endif>>
