title:zoeHelp
---
<<if social_check(14)>>
	She gazes up at you, almost confused.
	Like no one asked if she needed something in a long time.
	Zoe: Actually, yes.
<<elseif true>>
	She gazes up at you, a sliver of something off in her expression.
	-> What's up?
		She shakes off the expression, and goes back to her stoic look.
		Zoe: I'm fine thanks. But yes, you actually can.
	-> ...
<<endif>>
	Zoe: I've been trying to get a hold of Sully since this morning.
	Zoe: If you could tell him to come in my office that would be nice.
<<if set_flag("zoeAsk")>><<endif>><<if set_flag("zoeHelp")>><<endif>>
