<<elseif get_flag_uncheck("docs")and get_flag_uncheck("will")>>
	Zoe: You're still missing the medical documents and his will.
	Zoe: Come back when you have them, and stop wasting my time.
<<elseif get_flag_uncheck("log")and get_flag_uncheck("will")>>
	Zoe: You're still missing your log and his will.
	Zoe: Come back when you have them, and stop wasting my time.
<<elseif get_flag_uncheck("docs")and get_flag_uncheck("log")>>
	Zoe: You're still missing your log and the medical documents.
	Zoe: Come back when you have them, and stop wasting my time.
<<elseif get_flag_uncheck("log")>>
	Zoe: You're still missing the log.
	Zoe: Come back when you have it, and stop wasting my time.
<<elseif get_flag_uncheck("docs")>>
	Zoe: You're still missing the medical documents.
	Zoe: Come back when you have it, and stop wasting my time.
