title: zoeWill
---
Zoe: You know I was not his lawyer right?
-> Yes, but maybe you have an idea.
	She sighs dismissively.
	Zoe: Have you checked at the workshop on Ganymede. 
	Zoe: Employees are required to always charge their KomPat at a company station.
	-> Did my dad work for you?
		Yes. Now... do you need anything else? I've work to do.
	-> Thanks.
-> What's you job again?
	Zoe: EHP of the hospital...
	Zoe: Anyhow, have you checked at the workshop on Ganymede. 
	Zoe: Employees are required to always charge their KomPat at a company station.
	-> Did my dad work for you?
		Yes. Now... do you need anything else? I've work to do.
	-> Thanks.
